# NWL23_v5: PAT champion for NWL23 by the v5 recipe
# (notes/pat_champion_recipe.md, codex/pat-setup-value). Weights: the
# best of 4 seeds (61000002 + i - 1) of the iterative recipe (5 x 30K
# games from pat_zero_lexsigned_nofit) with the 14 float_through_*
# weights refitted under run_through,1 (150K games, seed 4242,
# fit_residual 3 during that fit). Tournament, whole game, 500000
# mirrored pairs, per pair:
#   seed 2 vs seed 1: mean -0.3549, SE 0.0898, 95% CI [-0.5309, -0.1790] (500000 pairs)
#   seed 3 vs seed 1: mean -0.0957, SE 0.0764, 95% CI [-0.2454, 0.0541] (500000 pairs)
#   seed 4 vs seed 1: mean -0.1830, SE 0.0860, 95% CI [-0.3515, -0.0145] (500000 pairs)
#   winner: seed 1
# Opening table: sim - static by tiles on 1000 seeded opening racks
# (patopeningsim:NWL23:NWL23_v5_s1_v4:1000), relative to the best bin.
# Validation vs no PAT (seed 777100099, 500000 pairs): mean 2.9234, SE 0.1340, 95% CI [2.6607, 3.1860] (500000 pairs)
